          </div>
          
          <button class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D4AF37] to-[#C5A572] hover:from-[#C5A572] hover:to-[#D4AF37] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 text-sm font-medium shadow-lg">
          Book
